  "description": "A woman on the verge of marriage gets caught up in an unexpected message from her once-obsessive ex-boyfriend.\n\nPromising herself it will be “just one last time” to end things for good, she agrees to meet him.\n\nBut the feelings she buried long ago—and a dangerous kind of pleasure—are awakened again, and even after she’s married, her ex’s intrusions and their forbidden relationship refuse to end.\n\nTorn between a peaceful future and corrupt desire, she finds herself trapped in a snare she can no longer escape…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4327006901), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13717257), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000076136), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260085)",
